<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR OPENS DOWN AT $70 IN NEW YORK.</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR OPENS DOWN AT $70 IN NEW YORK.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia Oy's A share ADR opened down $0-1/4 at $70 in New York on Monday.</p>
<p>The price corresponded to about 362.80 markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 235, news@reuters.fi</p>
